          },
          {
            "id": 2788103,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Like nearly everyone who comes here, I'm sure this is the first time you will have tried the art, so we'll keep things simple today. Now before we move on, can I just say a word about what you're wearing? As we said in our email, please remove any watches, necklaces, etcetera, and put them somewhere safe. If you have long hair, do tie it back now. We'll provide aprons later, but I trust your clothes are old but comfortable, not your favorite T shirt or jeans.",
