          {
            "id": 2788220,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "So now we're in the workshop. Have a look around. There's a lot going on. To make pottery that will last, you need a potter's wheel, a kiln, which is basically a very hot oven where you fire the pottery, and some tools. So first, the kiln.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2788221,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So now we're in the workshop.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 307.40002,
                  "from": 304.84,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2788228,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Have a look around.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 308.68,
                  "from": 307.64,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2788233,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "There's a lot going on.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 310.89502,
                  "from": 309.215,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2788239,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "To make pottery that will last, you need a potter's wheel, a kiln, which is basically a very hot oven where you fire the pottery, and some tools.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 323.215,
                  "from": 311.535,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2788268,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So first, the kiln.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 327.33002,
                  "from": 324.77002,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2788273,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "If you look over in the far corner, you'll see one of ours. Since their invention, kilns have changed very little, though in the past twenty years a lot of progress has been made in temperature control. Basically, a kiln removes the water from clay at temperatures of around a thousand degrees Celsius. This allows anything you've made to set permanently in shape. It's a pretty ugly heavy object that's hard to keep in a house or flat, so most people don't have one.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2788274,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "If you look over in the far corner, you'll see one of ours.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 332.21002,
                  "from": 327.73,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2788288,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Since their invention, kilns have changed very little, though in the past twenty years a lot of progress has been made in temperature control.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 342.685,
                  "from": 332.77002,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2788313,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Basically, a kiln removes the water from clay at temperatures of around a thousand degrees Celsius.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 351.245,
                  "from": 343.32498,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2788330,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "This allows anything you've made to set permanently in shape.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 357.21002,
                  "from": 352.17,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2788341,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It's a pretty ugly heavy object that's hard to keep in a house or flat, so most people don't have one.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 365.61002,
                  "from": 358.01,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2788342,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "You may think, can't I use my oven? Well, that's possible, but domestic ovens don't really get hot enough, and eventually the clay will crack and fall apart. Some people fire pottery in a fire pit outside, but bear in mind that can be dangerous. You also need to know about safety procedures for kilns as they release toxic compounds into the air. Every potter needs a potter's wheel.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2788343,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "You may think, can't I use my oven?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 370.275,
                  "from": 366.435,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2788352,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Well, that's possible, but domestic ovens don't really get hot enough, and eventually the clay will crack and fall apart.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 379.875,
                  "from": 370.75497,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2788373,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Some people fire pottery in a fire pit outside, but bear in mind that can be dangerous.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 389.73,
                  "from": 381.16998,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2788391,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "You also need to know about safety procedures for kilns as they release toxic compounds into the air.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 397.975,
                  "from": 390.61,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2788410,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Every potter needs a potter's wheel.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 403.095,
                  "from": 399.655,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2788417,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "This machine is used to shape the clay into an object with circular walls or sides, such as a bowl. Its invention revolutionised the pottery industry, allowing multiple items to be produced in a day. Lastly, there are a number of different tools that potters use, depending on what they want to make. When you start, your hands can make all kinds of shapes and curves without relying on a sculpting tool. However, there are some basic tools that you will need to handle the clay on the wheel.",
            "children": [
              {
